        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Active:</span> She begins a new <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Melody</span> and grants herself <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(20% + (2% per 100 Ability Power)) Move Speed</span> for 3 seconds, extended to up to 7 seconds if she doesn't take damage. <br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Melody:</span> Sona gains an aura for 3 seconds that grants allied champions <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(10/12/14/16/18% + (2% per 100 Ability Power)) Move Speed</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Power Chord - Tempo:</span> Power Chord also <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> the target by (50% + (4% per 100 Ability Power)) for 2 seconds.",
